# GuitarFreaks 11th Mix: a game, from what gtfrk11m-boot left (its NVRAM). Two coins, then Start
# every 300 frames: the session WELCOME (no other cabinet: it plays alone), the mode and music
# select (their defaults), the first stage played with no input to GAME OVER, and attract again.
# Also what tools/mipsrec.py records for the R3000 recompiler's gameplay blocks.
game gtfrk11m

at 10800 press "Coin 1" 8
at 10850 press "Coin 1" 8
from 11000 every 300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 8400 every 600 snap
at 19800 quit
